   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When to use the pluperfect",
     "texto": [
      "When you tell something that happened in the passato prossimo and need to explain a fact that had already been completed before, you use the pluperfect: **Quando sono andata al cinema, avevo già comprato il biglietto** (when I went to the cinema, I had already bought the ticket).",
      "The adverb **già** (already) is usually placed between the auxiliary and the participle: **avevo già letto**, **era già partita**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Main clause (past)",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Earlier clause (pluperfect)",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Chronological meaning",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
